{
  "id": "ISA.62",
  "number": "62",
  "bookId": "ISA",
  "reference": "Isaia 62",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 12,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "62",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 62"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "62",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Egu Sion lapkeiyetab ng’ony komugul",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Masise agobo Sion, amamuunyi agobo Jerusalem, agoi komanda imandanyi ko u kaluunet, ak komanda yetunennyi ko u tait ne lalei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kogeer bororiosiek imandang’ung’, ak kogeer laitorinik tugul torornateng’ung’: ak keguurenen kainet ne leel, ne tun kuurenen Jehovah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iegu kogeny narietab kororonindo eng’ eutab Jehovah, ak iegu narietab laitornatet eng’ eutab Kamuktaindeng’ung’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma keguurenen kogeny Ne Kigimeto; ama keguure emeng’ung’ kogeny Karaita: ago kiguurenen Hepsi-ba, ak keguure emeng’ung’ Beula: amu baibaitunenen Jehovah, ak kitun emeng’ung’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ko u ye ituni mureno bergeiyat, u noto tun itunin weriguk: ak ko u ye baibaitu sandet eng’ mureret, ko u noto, tun boiboitu Kamuktaindeng’ung’ eng’ inye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kande ribik irimoiguk, ee Jerusalem; magoi sisyo bet anan kemoi; amomuunyi okwek bik che obwatyini Jehovah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amogochini inendet komuuny, agoi kogimit Jerusalem ak koyai koek kalosunet eng’ ng’ony. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kigoyosio Jehovah eng’ eunnyi ne bo tai, ak eng’ eutab kimnatennyi, kole, Iman, ma agoitoi beguk koek amitwogikab buniguk; ama koee toek divaiguk, che kiiyai: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ago amei ichek che kigonori, ak kolos Jehovah; ak koee ichek che kiyumi, eng’ seremusiekab oldanyu ne tilil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omande, omandae ormarichok; ochob oretab bik; ochob, ochob oret ne o; oiste koik; onamji barak songoliet agobo bik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogeero, kagomwaita Jehovah agoi tabandab ng’ony, kole, Olenji cheptab Sion, Keero, nyonei yetuneng’ung’; keero, mi melektanyi koboto inendet, ak mi yaaktaennyi tainnyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak koguure ichek, Bik che tililen, Che kigotiach Jehovah: ak keguurenen, Ne Kigicheng’, Nganaset ne ma kimeto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
